      "role": "user",
      "content": "integrate it? how? the machines do it faster, deeper, and without the soul i put into it. i feel like a ghost haunting my own study. there's no \"integration\" for someone who has finished their part in the story. i'm just waiting for the credits to roll, but the theater is empty.",
